---
// Quiz figure for Post 7: Comparing two commercial banks via P/B, ROE, and implied P/E.
---
<div class="qfig-sbq07tri">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 185" role="img" aria-label="Comparing Bank A (BVPS 20,000, Price 30,000, P/B 1.50x, ROE 20%) against Bank B (BVPS 20,000, Price 16,000, P/B 0.80x, ROE 8%).">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two Commercial Banks: P/B = P/E × ROE Identity</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>So sánh hai ngân hàng: Đẳng thức P/B = P/E × ROE</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="44" width="262" height="124" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="32" y="72" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Bank A (High Efficiency)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ngân hàng A (Hiệu quả cao)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="100">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Price: 30,000 đ | BVPS: 20,000 đ</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thị giá: 30.000 đ | BVPS: 20.000 đ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="126">P/B = 1.50× | ROE = 20%</text>
    <text x="32" y="152" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>EPS = 4,000 đ → Implied P/E = ?</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>EPS = 4.000 đ → P/E tương ứng = ?</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="302" y="44" width="262" height="124" rx="8" class="qfig-card-red" />
    <text x="318" y="72" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Bank B (Low P/B Headline)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ngân hàng B (P/B dưới 1)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="100">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Price: 16,000 đ | BVPS: 20,000 đ</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thị giá: 16.000 đ | BVPS: 20.000 đ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="126">P/B = 0.80× | ROE = 8%</text>
    <text x="318" y="152" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>EPS = 1,600 đ → Implied P/E = ?</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>EPS = 1.600 đ → P/E tương ứng = ?</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq07tri { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq07tri svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq07tri text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq07tri .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq07tri .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq07tri .qfig-m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-sbq07tri .qfig-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq07tri .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq07tri .qfig-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
